# The operational CSVs (Users, Doctors, Nurses, Wards, EDbeds, Shifts, Groups,
# DailyPatients, LogPatients, relation tables) AND the ML historical training
# data (edstays_with_synth.csv, meteo.csv) ARE all shipped in the image —
# they are this hospital's real existing lookup/configuration/historical data
# and db-init transports them into SQL Server on first install via
# migrate_csv_to_mssql.py and import_ml_historical_data.py, per the RAH
# Operator Manual's "first installation must include lookup data, must not
# recreate it" rule. Patients.csv (~38MB historical patient-intake sampler
# dataset for the Simulation feature) is shipped too — the sampler reads it
# directly, no SQL Server round trip (see dataset_sampler.py).

scratch_download/
